  "summary": "Yes. Mastodon posting activity in February 2024 showed a clear hourly pattern, with volume peaking in the afternoon, especially around 16:00. Activity was lowest in the early morning hours.",
  "key_points": [
    "The highest post volume occurred at 16:00, with 84652 posts.",
"Second-highest hours: 15:00 UTC (83,647 posts) and 17:00 UTC (83,828 posts)",
              "Lowest hour: 05:00 UTC (5 AM) with 41,332 posts",    "Overall, Mastodon activity increased steadily from the morning, peaked in the late afternoon, and then gradually declined through the evening."
  ]
}

